  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台北m̄是我ê故鄉"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Tân Lō͘</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台北m̄是我ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia無細漢時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">朋友做伙騎車sì-kè chhit-thô</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khòng窯放炮仔ê記憶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台北m̄是我ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia無早起時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿媽ê豆油炒飯kap豆乳ùn醬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">厝內公媽廳ê香hu氣味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台北m̄是我ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia無腹肚iau ê時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔壁麵擔仔滷肉飯、扁食麵</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">25箍hō͘我食thàng海ê阿姨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台北m̄是我ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia無我頭一擺</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">家己學騎跤踏車</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">跋倒摔kah跤頭趺全血</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Soah完全無háu出聲</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ê hit个廟埕</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台北m̄是我ê故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chia是阿爸阿母拍拚ê城市</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā是in無法度離開ê一世人tak纏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In ǹg望ê人生lóng tī chia</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chit-má ê頂頭首長</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你m̄是古早皇帝獨裁者</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">算計o͘-se假做龜仔囝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">翻頭認錯收尾iáu ē赴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mài烏白舞　kā人當做你</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鬥爭輸贏ê棋子凊彩使弄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/s1424/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgUCHfP9ZcxoO5pj47vRJ8D_G6bxhv3plnQQN-e6AaaV7unEvPASs6JtnS_YfwT_RbfUyKhnNnc91t4N0GHRtUweHrT7QqEi3hBJeU7LnLBlcNBTKNvTlMZH6fONUqYTV8-YYFIVqPLbfMjVDiifwVr7UalvYcBLsJ0zocr_JPM67l1OK6MvfPK1Ccycg/w450-h640/343%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdnu6udAcmQLpgZz9bkfI0ychCiEAdYMcgFZAkThsBRE4ac1Jh_2kEltVKtkSIfEXvIYqF594Nn3ho9JFF556A-777AIDOAh6SUJL5yVxPbLNk6aOGbw73RzsjuGKnCTiBw5rKYNeBnZqIP_fPePbD9PB4LpJw9rRm5i9jUUL4tE25TQ4Rfy2mCzgFnQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_043.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdnu6udAcmQLpgZz9bkfI0ychCiEAdYMcgFZAkThsBRE4ac1Jh_2kEltVKtkSIfEXvIYqF594Nn3ho9JFF556A-777AIDOAh6SUJL5yVxPbLNk6aOGbw73RzsjuGKnCTiBw5rKYNeBnZqIP_fPePbD9PB4LpJw9rRm5i9jUUL4tE25TQ4Rfy2mCzgFnQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1343%E6%9C%9F_043.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>做伙來唸詩&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦ê漢字kap傳統白話字。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a c